# Cloudflare Pages redirects — the replacement for the RedirectMatch rules the
# deploy workflow wrote into Hostinger's .htaccess. Apache config does not
# travel with the site, so without this file these 301s disappear silently on
# the move and the old WordPress URLs start 404ing.
#
# Both the bare and trailing-slash forms are listed: Pages matches literal
# paths, where Apache's regexes handled `/?$` for us.

/attributes                 /                     301
/attributes/                /                     301
/category/uncategorized     /                     301
/category/uncategorized/    /                     301
/sitemap_index.xml          /sitemap-index.xml    301
